1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,036
Xu Yan,

2
00:00:01,322 --> 00:00:01,805
I…

3
00:00:04,717 --> 00:00:06,460
Honored Jieyuan,

4
00:00:06,527 --> 00:00:08,918
we were blind!

5
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:10,034
…Squire Zhou?

6
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:12,783
That match back then,

7
00:00:12,849 --> 00:00:15,690
was this old fool's mistake.

8
00:00:19,828 --> 00:00:21,543
Ginseng, silver, a jade ruyi,

9
00:00:21,848 --> 00:00:23,166
three hundred taels, at least.

10
00:00:23,679 --> 00:00:24,229
Squire,

11
00:00:24,377 --> 00:00:24,923
please rise.

12
00:00:25,148 --> 00:00:25,923
That old debt,

13
00:00:26,509 --> 00:00:27,632
isn't mine to settle.

14
00:00:27,851 --> 00:00:28,958
Then…

15
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,523
the gifts?

16
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,381
The gifts,

17
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:32,414
please take them back.

18
00:00:33,007 --> 00:00:33,908
Three hundred taels…

19
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:35,702
You're refusing?

20
00:00:35,757 --> 00:00:36,703
Does it hurt?

21
00:00:37,258 --> 00:00:38,153
Jieyuan,

22
00:00:38,423 --> 00:00:40,412
this old man is late.

23
00:00:40,997 --> 00:00:41,858
His Excellency the prefect

24
00:00:42,588 --> 00:00:44,426
asked me to bring you this.

25
00:00:45,603 --> 00:00:46,993
Let me give you one saying:

26
00:00:47,049 --> 00:00:48,911
the tallest tree catches the wind.

27
00:00:48,977 --> 00:00:49,454
Your student

28
00:00:49,692 --> 00:00:50,381
will remember it.

29
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:50,975
Tonight,

30
00:00:51,153 --> 00:00:52,665
drinks are on the Tang family!

31
00:00:52,787 --> 00:00:53,304
Cousin,

32
00:00:53,369 --> 00:00:54,324
your big cousin drinks to you!

33
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:55,687
Dalang,

34
00:00:55,937 --> 00:00:56,616
bottoms up!

35
00:00:56,843 --> 00:00:57,752
Honored Jieyuan,

36
00:00:58,089 --> 00:00:59,578
tonight it's on the house!

37
00:01:01,657 --> 00:01:02,555
Upstairs.

38
00:01:02,611 --> 00:01:03,896
I need to talk to you.

39
00:01:04,142 --> 00:01:05,051
Upstairs?

40
00:01:05,104 --> 00:01:06,426
So early?

41
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,699
That jade,

42
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:10,890
let me see it.

43
00:01:11,521 --> 00:01:12,158
That day,

44
00:01:12,918 --> 00:01:14,109
your face went pale.

45
00:01:16,366 --> 00:01:17,858
This was my father's.

46
00:01:18,302 --> 00:01:19,183
My father

47
00:01:19,244 --> 00:01:21,089
is Qin Lieshan.

48
00:01:21,238 --> 00:01:21,964
I know.

49
00:01:22,089 --> 00:01:23,150
Tell me. I'm listening.

50
00:01:23,218 --> 00:01:25,109
He wore it close for twenty years,

51
00:01:25,177 --> 00:01:26,226
never took it off.

52
00:01:26,851 --> 00:01:28,218
How it ended up in your hands,

53
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:29,726
I don't know either.

54
00:01:29,787 --> 00:01:31,049
It was just lying in the old book chest;

55
00:01:31,261 --> 00:01:34,443
who put it there, I don't remember.

56
00:01:36,082 --> 00:01:36,907
When we find him,

57
00:01:36,970 --> 00:01:38,418
I'll give it back to him myself.

58
00:01:38,477 --> 00:01:39,527
…Mm.

59
00:01:39,677 --> 00:01:41,115
Side quest complete:

60
00:01:41,176 --> 00:01:43,095
the owner of the jade pendant.

61
00:01:46,832 --> 00:01:48,058
What are you doing?

62
00:01:50,032 --> 00:01:50,879
The stairs…

63
00:01:50,935 --> 00:01:52,305
someone's there.

64
00:01:53,263 --> 00:01:55,151
Qin Shuang, a disgraced official's daughter,

65
00:01:55,256 --> 00:01:56,332
deserting the military register,

66
00:01:56,665 --> 00:01:57,544
seize her!

67
00:01:59,564 --> 00:01:59,981
Hold it!
